\\frac{1}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509847} {:answer/id #uuid "4fcaa2b8-b53e-57c5-bb30-a9e4289aa081" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\,\\frac{1}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509855} {:answer/id #uuid "598b4d6b-45a5-5d71-bce7-4f8b0f8e22a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\,\\frac{2}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509874} {:answer/id #uuid "728aa58f-57cb-5136-9754-148669dae9b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\,\\frac{2}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509925} {:answer/id #uuid "d59076de-8e00-5557-b8ef-6aad547d73e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\,\\frac{2}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510140}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4d68b516-9901-561b-9284-284a39ac9db3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\,\\frac{1}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509847} :answer-field/id #uuid "4bfc692b-2350-57db-b02c-fe993e24627e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510277}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "482bced9-3212-5918-a8c9-a1d576cd678a" :question/math-academy-id "q-70169" :question/problem "$\\frac{5}{12}\\times 8=$" :question/worked-solution "To multiply a fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction's numerator by the whole number and keep the denominator the same:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5\\times 8}{12}=\\frac{40}{12}\n$$\n\nWe then simplify:\n\n$$\n\\frac{40}{12}=\\frac{40÷4}{12÷4}=\\frac{10}{3}\n$$\n\nFinally, we then convert $\\frac{10}{3}$ to a mixed number:\n\n$$\n10÷3=3\\,\\text{R}1=3\\,\\frac{1}{3}\n$$"}]}
